# Components

## Naming

- **kebab-case** for shadcn primitives: `button.tsx`, `card.tsx`, `input.tsx`
- **PascalCase** for composites: `GenericDataGrid.tsx`, `StatusDropdown.tsx`, `DateRangePicker.tsx`

## When to add to shared/

Add reusable UI with no domain logic. Entity selects (`CountrySelect`) live in `shared/components/selects/`.

## Button

Use `variant` + `size` from CVA. Pass `loading` for async actions.

## Forms

Use `BaseInputField` inside `FormProvider`. Do not bind inputs manually when a base field exists.

## Modals

Use `ModalStatus` for confirm/delete and form modals. Pass `type="delete"` for destructive confirms.
